\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Sing to the great Jehovah's praise;
\par All praise to Him belongs;
\par WHo kindly lengthens out our days
\par Demands our choicest songs.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. His providence hath brought us
\par through
\par Another various year;
\par We all with vows and anthems new
\par Before our God appear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Father, Thy mercies past we own;
\par Thy still continued care;
\par To Thee presenting, through Thy Son,
\par Whate'er we have or are.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Our lips and lives shall gladly show
\par Thine, wholly Thine, shall be;
\par And all our consecrated powers
\par A sacrifice to Thee.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

